# CDN-level redirects (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify).
# Astro `output: static` cannot serve runtime redirects, so /en/ prefix
# stripping and retired localized blog URLs are handled here.
# Blog is English-only: locale-prefixed blog URLs fold to the canonical /blog.

/en/*  /:splat  301
/en  /  301

/ru/blog/*  /blog/:splat  301
/ru/blog  /blog  301
/zh/blog/*  /blog/:splat  301
/zh/blog  /blog  301
/ko/blog/*  /blog/:splat  301
/ko/blog  /blog  301
/ja/blog/*  /blog/:splat  301
/ja/blog  /blog  301
/tr/blog/*  /blog/:splat  301
/tr/blog  /blog  301
/pt-BR/blog/*  /blog/:splat  301
/pt-BR/blog  /blog  301
